{"articleNo":"561600","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=561600&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2026년 화성시인재육성재단 주거비지원 장학금 신청 안내","writer":"학생과","writeDate":"2026.05.07","hit":"3270","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmDYHoQVkhLANgYwPIGVEDECyB7ARwEUAnAUwHUAXHHAFQHMA5AOgAcA7BoA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-size: 12px; text-indent: -15.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">장학금명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">화성시인재육성재단 주거비지원 장학금</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-size: 12px; text-indent: -15.9pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">지원자격</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.9pt; font-size: 12px; text-indent: -15.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.2pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 1)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.2pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">본인 또는 부모</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.2pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.2pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">친권자가 화성시에서&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.2pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.2pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">년 이상 연속 거주한 비수도권 대학 재학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 37.2pt; font-size: 12px; text-indent: -37.2pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">비수도권</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">서울</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">경기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">인천을 제외한 국내 지역</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.9pt; font-size: 12px; text-indent: -15.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 2)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">한국장학재단 학자금 지원구간&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">5</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">분위 이내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.9pt; font-size: 12px; text-indent: -15.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 3)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">대학교 인근에서 자취 또는 기숙사 입소자로 증빙서류 제출 가능한 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.9pt; font-size: 12px; text-indent: -15.9pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">지원금액</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: 200</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">만원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">학기당&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">100</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">만원씩 분할지급</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.9pt; font-size: 12px; text-indent: -15.9pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">모집기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: 2026. 5. 6.(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) 10</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">시&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">~ 5. 22.(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) 17</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">시</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.9pt; text-indent: -15.9pt;\"><font face=\"굴림체\">마. 문의사항: 화성시인재육성재단 장학사업팀(031-898-5625)</font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
